Option: reserve-window
Name: Spring Reserve buttons only inside the booking window
Does: Buttons marked data-book show only from 3 weeks before the strawberry season starts (about March 25) until it ends. Summer and fall state no window, so their buttons are never hidden by this (the November 9 to 17 gap stays). The phone bar keeps its buttons evenly spaced.
Answers: d25 A (Reserve buttons when nothing can be booked)
Conflicts: none
Requires: none
Host: any
Order: 20
After: python3 tools/pages.py (the usual rebuild line is fine too)
Strings: none

